WEBVTT

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.571
"Pojdi in se bori sam,"

00:12:01.571 --> 00:12:06.776
in več takih, kjer se mora pridružiti ekipi,

00:12:06.776 --> 00:12:10.876
ki jo morda vodi ženska,

00:12:10.876 --> 00:12:16.496
da bi drugim ljudem pomagali postati boljši

00:12:16.496 --> 00:12:18.888
in da bi sami bili boljši.

00:12:18.888 --> 00:12:21.170
kot v "Čarovniku iz Oza".

00:12:21.170 --> 00:12:34.479
Hvala.